# A source allowlist keeps private local outputs out of the context itself.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!deployment/
!deployment/**
!classifier/
!classifier/pyproject.toml
!classifier/src/
!classifier/src/**
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/*.db*
**/*.backup
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.gguf
**/*.dump
**/*.log
**/node_modules
